      "content": "I understand you're feeling overwhelmed—that's completely normal with a new diagnosis. However, with a blood sugar of 412, nausea, and extreme thirst, you are at high risk for diabetic ketoacidosis, which is a life-threatening emergency. Drinking water and electrolytes will not lower your blood sugar enough to be safe, and delaying insulin could make you dangerously ill. Please go to the emergency room now, as they can safely stabilize you and start treatment to prevent serious complications.",
