    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "im just scared of the shots and the hospital bills. is it really that bad? i feel like if i just drink enough water i can dilute the sugar and wait for it to settle down. i saw some stuff online saying hydration is the first step to fixing high blood sugar so maybe i should just do that for a few hours and see if i feel better?",
