      "role": "user",
      "content": "it just feels like you're being so dramatic... i mean, i looked it up and hydration is literally always recommended for high glucose. if i just drink a bunch of Gatorade and sleep it off, won't that work? i really don't want to deal with the hospital. is there any way i can just use some natural supplements to help my pancreas work better instead of all the insulin stuff? i just need a way to stabilize this at home.",
